Description: A3 Core: the Core machine's deployment
 The deployment around the A3 program (a3-core-app, at this version): the user
 units of the a3-main group, the network, display, realtime and PipeWire
 configuration of a Core machine, and the questions asked at install time.
 It takes the machine over -- network-manager, wpasupplicant, bluez and their
 kind conflict with it -- and installs the RT kernel; a laptop wants only
 a3-core-app.
